1. Grade Checker
Take a score as input and print the grade based on the following:
90+ : "A"
80-89 : "B"
70-79 : "C"
60-69 : "D"
Below 60 : "F"
here we used a basic if else statement to carry out marks and all.


Sol:1-

score =int(input("Enter your score:"))
if score >=90:
    print("Grade: A")
elif score>=80:
    print("Grade: B")
elif score>=70:
    print("Grade: C")
elif score>=60:
    print("Grade: D")
else:
    print("Grade: F")

